      "level": 7,
      "parent": null,
      "ja": "",
      "en": "Cellular immunotherapy (medicinal preparations containing antigens or antibodies A61K39/00)<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>This group covers isolated cells of the immune system presenting or targeting a specific antigen or a mix of antigens for use in therapy.<br>In this main group, the last place priority rule is not applied, i.e. the common rule is applied.<br>In this group, C-Sets are used for classification. The detailed information about the C-Sets construction and the associated syntax rules are found in the Definitions of A61K40/00.",
      "count": 234,
      "ipcCode": "A61K40/00",
