      "en": "Antibodies; Immunoglobulins; Fragments thereof<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br> the protein being an antibody, an immunoglobulin or a fragment thereof. If the MRI-active nucleus being linked to the antibody via a complexing or chelating group, the subgroup A61K49/085 should also be given ",
